            "value" : "This is the whole message: that %1$@ couldn't answer, what M1K3 showed you, the app and system versions, M1K3's download log from this session, and any brain errors this device kept. Nothing you typed or said goes with it. It goes to %2$@ from your own mail app, which opens with it filled in. M1K3 sends nothing itself. Round Tower reads it to find what went wrong, and deletes it if you ask."
